{"id":"wb-7-941","name":"农安辽塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"农安辽塔","text":"农安辽塔，位于中华人民共和国吉林省长春市农安县农安镇，是中华人民共和国现存最北端的佛塔。该塔始建于辽代，历经多次修缮，于2013年3月入选第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%9C%E5%AE%89%E8%BE%BD%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94149943,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94149943","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/52a3824b9cc6f3b27c03eef8.jpg","title":"Nong'an_Liaota_Tower.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nong%27an_Liaota_Tower.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/Nong%27an_Liaota_Tower.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"JacobLyu","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​始建于辽圣宗时期的农安辽塔","width":320,"height":662}}